+/-! # B3: proofs
+
+* `dhl_implies_gap`: DHL[k, 2] and one admissible `k`-tuple of diameter `D` give `H₁ ≤ D`.
+* `wtrick_coprime`: the coprimality step of Lemma 4.9.
